1
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:04,715
A Mars mission trainer for kids seven to twelve.

2
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:07,491
Three cats. One crash.

3
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:09,463
Meowstronauts: Mars Outpost.

4
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:12,573
Seven sols. Every choice costs something.

5
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:15,155
Save the shield, or save the crew.

6
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:18,515
Then practice the hard parts: land the ship, hop the ridge.

7
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:21,831
Tap a word. Learn the science.

8
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:25,587
Real NASA data: the May 2025 X2.7 flare.

9
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:27,174
One choice they'll remember.

